          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Compatibility and connectivity</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Compatibility with other LIFEPAK electrodes and monitors speeds the transition to the next level of care.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Post-event patient and performance data can be easily viewed, analyzed and managed with <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/code-stat.html\">CODE-STAT data review software</a> – helping to improve future response and target training needs.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Apr 24 2024 14:34:59 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
